<title>ARGENTINA: ARGENTINA'S SEVEL H1 NET LOSS $44.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>ARGENTINA'S SEVEL H1 NET LOSS $44.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30. Net loss $44.8 million vs n/a. NOTE: SEVEL Argentina SA, which makes Peugeot cars under license, provided neither comparative, EPS nor ADR information. It did not detail second quarter results. It said first half results were after a $24.5 million extraordinary loss.  </p>
<p>The company reported a net worth of $338.99 million and retained earnings of $33.18 million.</p>
<p>((-Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
